"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-400/20 border border-amber-400/40\"></div><div><p class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">10+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Featured Journeys</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-400/20 border border-amber-400/40\"></div><div><p class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">50+</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Destinations</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-400/20 border border-amber-400/40\"></div><div><p class=\"font-bold text-amber-300\">7-16</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Days per Journey</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3\"></path></svg></div></section><section class=\"sticky top-20 bg-black/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-amber-700/30 py-6 px-6 z-40\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-6 relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search absolute left-4 top-3.5 text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search journeys...\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-900 border border-amber-700/30 rounded-sm pl-12 pr-4 py-3 text-white placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-600\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"text-sm uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest block mb-3\">Region</label><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-amber-600 text-black\">All</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">Europe</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">Asia</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">Africa</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">South America</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">Arctic</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">Indian Ocean</button></div></div><div><label class=\"text-sm uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest block mb-3\">Duration</label><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-amber-600 text-black\">All</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">7-10 nights</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">11-14 nights</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm text-sm font-medium transition bg-gray-900 text-gray-300 hover:border-amber-600/60 border border-amber-700/30\">15+ nights</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><p class=\"text-gray-400 font-light mb-8\">8<!-- --> journey<!-- -->s<!-- --> found</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"group border border-amber-700/30 rounded-sm overflow-hidden hover:border-amber-600/60 transition\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 h-64 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700\">[Featured Image: <!-- -->The Art of Living: Renaissance Italy<!-- -->]</div></div><div class=\"p-8\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest\">Europe</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold mt-2 mb-1\">The Art of Living: Renaissance Italy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light italic\">Discovering Masterpieces, Culture, and Timeless Elegance</p></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-2\">Immerse yourself in the world of Renaissance masters across Florence, Venice, and the Amalfi Coast. This curated journey takes you beyond the guidebook—exclusive access to private art collections, intimate meals with Italian historians, and evenings in centuries-old villas overlooking the Mediterranean.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 py-6 border-t border-b border-amber-700/20\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">12<!-- --> nights</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">2-6<!-- --> guests</span></div><div class=\"col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-semibold\">$<!-- -->24,500<!-- --> per person</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-3\">Highlights</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Private museum access</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Michelin-starred dining</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Villa stays</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Art historian guides</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-700/20\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2\">Best For</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Art enthusiasts, cultural travelers</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500 transition font-semibold text-sm group/btn\" href=\"/journeys/1\">View Full Itinerary<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group border border-amber-700/30 rounded-sm overflow-hidden hover:border-amber-600/60 transition\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 h-64 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700\">[Featured Image: <!-- -->Untouched Wilderness: Arctic Expedition<!-- -->]</div></div><div class=\"p-8\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest\">Arctic</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold mt-2 mb-1\">Untouched Wilderness: Arctic Expedition</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light italic\">Northern Lights, Indigenous Culture, and Pristine Landscapes</p></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-2\">Journey to the edge of the world. Experience the raw beauty of Norwegian Lapland, where the Northern Lights dance above untouched Arctic tundra. Stay in luxury lodges, meet Sámi herders, and witness Earth&#x27;s most profound natural phenomena.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 py-6 border-t border-b border-amber-700/20\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">10<!-- --> nights</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">4-8<!-- --> guests</span></div><div class=\"col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-semibold\">$<!-- -->18,900<!-- --> per person</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-3\">Highlights</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Northern Lights viewing</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Sámi cultural immersion</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Luxury Arctic lodges</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Expert naturalists</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-700/20\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2\">Best For</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Adventure seekers, nature lovers</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500 transition font-semibold text-sm group/btn\" href=\"/journeys/2\">View Full Itinerary<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group border border-amber-700/30 rounded-sm overflow-hidden hover:border-amber-600/60 transition\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 h-64 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700\">[Featured Image: <!-- -->Sacred Journeys: Ancient Asia Unveiled<!-- -->]</div></div><div class=\"p-8\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest\">Asia</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold mt-2 mb-1\">Sacred Journeys: Ancient Asia Unveiled</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light italic\">Spirituality, Temples, and Transformative Experiences</p></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-2\">From the misty mountains of Tibet to the sacred temples of Kyoto, this transformative journey connects you with Asia&#x27;s spiritual heart. Private meditation sessions with monks, sunrise ceremonies at ancient temples, and encounters with master craftspeople.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 py-6 border-t border-b border-amber-700/20\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">16<!-- --> nights</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">2-4<!-- --> guests</span></div><div class=\"col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-semibold\">$<!-- -->28,750<!-- --> per person</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-3\">Highlights</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Temple stays</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Meditation training</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Craftspeople meetings</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Private ceremonies</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-700/20\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2\">Best For</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Spiritual travelers, seekers</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500 transition font-semibold text-sm group/btn\" href=\"/journeys/3\">View Full Itinerary<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"group border border-amber-700/30 rounded-sm overflow-hidden hover:border-amber-600/60 transition\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 h-64 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700\">[Featured Image: <!-- -->Serengeti Serene: African Safari Luxury<!-- -->]</div></div><div class=\"p-8\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest\">Africa</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-bold mt-2 mb-1\">Serengeti Serene: African Safari Luxury</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm font-light italic\">Wildlife, Conservation, and the Rhythm of the Savanna</p></div><p class=\"text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed mb-6 line-clamp-2\">Experience Africa&#x27;s greatest wilderness from intimate, all-inclusive safari camps. Expert trackers, private vehicle expeditions, encounters with indigenous Maasai communities, and conservation-focused experiences. Witness the great migration.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 py-6 border-t border-b border-amber-700/20\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 