 Alpine views, and Michelin-starred dining in mountain chalets.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 py-6 border-t border-b border-amber-700/20\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">10<!-- --> nights</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300\">2-8<!-- --> guests</span></div><div class=\"col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-gray-300 font-semibold\">$<!-- -->21,500<!-- --> per person</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-3\">Highlights</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Ski access</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Mountain biking</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Spa facilities</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-amber-600/10 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700/30\">Fine dining</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 pt-4 border-t border-amber-700/20\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase text-gray-500 font-semibold tracking-widest mb-2\">Best For</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Sports enthusiasts, luxury seekers</p></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-500 transition font-semibold text-sm group/btn\" href=\"/journeys/8\">View Full Itinerary<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6 border-t border-amber-700/30 bg-gradient-to-b from-black to-amber-900/10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4\">Can&#x27;t find what you&#x27;re looking for?</h2><p class=\"text-gray-300 font-light mb-6\">Our specialists can design a custom journey tailored to your specific interests and preferences.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-amber-600 text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-amber-500 transition font-semibold\" href=\"/contact\">Design Custom Journey</a></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03cfer45fiu76.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f